g\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171340/extras/e9a4b9b6bc4c5dfc5bf987123483cafd.avif?t=1769941615\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171340/extras_big/e9a4b9b6bc4c5dfc5bf987123483cafd.avif?t=1769941615 width=800 height=800 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lighter, an indispensable prop for exploration at night</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make friends who can be regarded as sworn friends through thick and thin</h2></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of your friends, you will come to the <strong>Mountain Park</strong>, find out the truth of the matter, defeat the real mastermind behind the scenes, and become the support for people all over the world. After purchasing this game, you will experience the double excitement brought by horror games and action games. The enemies have different defense methods. Use the magical props to deal with the unknown monsters.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171340/extras/cef11f5ad836450e4a19b46aa663e37d.avif?t=1769941615\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171340/extras_big/cef11f5ad836450e4a19b46aa663e37d.avif?t=1769941615 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The wheels of history never stop.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3171340/39a601587b50c63d772045108c5c411a7a15c58b.jpg"},{"name":"If the last slice of pizza can fill you up, why bother with the others?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3171340/b20f2b8980a0f6032e877acf04cba03563785e66.jpg"},{"name":"The five notes cause people to be deaf.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3171340/40555cd8276ecd8a2fb76e6022f894820efc8a62.jpg"},{"name":"Even pigs 